n to you?\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1073 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 40s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1020 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 40s shakes their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A person, maybe 40s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 40s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 40s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A person, maybe 40s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Emberhold, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the west ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"A person, maybe 40s hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half rati