ear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":87,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":87,"line":"At the grave, Arnold, Cheryl, Rahaf and 5 more speak for Nitaya — \"Carmine trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":88,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":88,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,639 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Hank clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":88,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":90,"line":"Donated Blackberry (+3575 kcal). Trust +1. They'll remember this."},{"day":90,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":91,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":92,"line":"At the grave, Arnold, Cheryl, Rahaf and 4 more speak for Maya — \"Nitaya trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":93,"line":"At the grave,