10.)"},{"day":99,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1470 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":100,"line":"Nurlaela hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":100,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They carried off ~1375 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":101,"line":"Nurlaela hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":101,"line":"Nurlaela hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":101,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":101,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":101,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,584 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":104,"line":"◈ Galym Iskakov walks out of the light alone, which is how he walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":3,"wave4":0,"wave5":0,"w4Day":null,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":104,"gameDays":104,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"global","deaths":[{"day":5,"kind":"monster","who":"