"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":9,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the northwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":10,"line":"Lucas hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":12,"line":"Booker counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"0 for guilty. 5 against.\""},{"day":20,"line":"🌙 Raid — Ashford came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":23,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the south. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":25,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the south. They carried off ~818 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"Nora hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":26,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" Nathan says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":26,"line":"David hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Booker brings it home: Haven bows to Emberhold — one organization, them primary. Tribute: 5,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in 