om Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":98,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":98,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":100,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":100,"line":"You accept Thornfield's food — 1,975 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Amara clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":101,"line":"⚡ TECHNIQUE UNLOCKED: Deep Read! You don't just read trust — you read intent. Know what they'll do next. (Your knowledge of Reading People amplifies your open_book.)"},{"day":101,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Carl, Lucía and 4 more speak for Nathan — \"Michelle trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":102,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Thornfield in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":102,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Lucía, Hassan and 3 more speak for Carl — \"Nathan trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":103,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Hassan, Sigrun and 2 more speak for Lucía — \"Carl trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":103,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":104,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Hassan, Sigrun and 1 more speak for Lena — \"Lucía trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":104,"line":"At the grave, Earl, Hassan, Sigrun speak for Sofia — \"Lena trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"At the grave, Hassan, Sigrun speak for Earl — \"Sofia trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":105,"line":"◈ Earl Doyle walks out of the light alone, which is how he walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":87,"w5Day":null,"national":1,"table":1,"won":1,"days":105,"gameDays":105,"endReason":"over-other","endScaleRank":"global","deaths":[{"day":6,"kind":"monster","who":"nightcourt","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":7,"kind":"person","who":"gen_sbp7zos","cause":"ambush","player":false},{"day":10,"kind":"villager","who":"gen_v84iyx6","cause":"the wild","player":true},{"day":11,"kind":"person","who":"elena_petrova","cause":"ambush","player":false},{"day":22,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":27,"kind":"monster","who":"anaconda_empress","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":38,"kind":"monster","who":"understudy","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":47,"kind":"monster","who":"understudy","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":50,"kind":"monster","who":"cliffhanger","cause":"combat","player":false},{"day":57,"kind":"monster","who":"hushwolf","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":64,"kind":"monster","who":"bright_idea","cause":"villager combat","player":false},{"day":69,"kind":"monster","who":"giant_mosquit