lks out of the light alone, which is how she walked in — and the galaxy, which came to watch a monster, leaves afraid of the right things. The fear is a shield now, held over a village that trusts the hand that holds it."},{"day":122,"line":"You accept Ashford's food — 2,339 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Alba clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"}],"callLines":[],"heraldAttempts":[{"day":114,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":114,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":116,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":116,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":116,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":117,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":117,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"},{"day":117,"cls":"REFUSED","reason":"MUSTER-GATE","caller":"wild-contact"}],"musterRefusals":[{"idx":0,"day":114,"sayText":"⛔ THE HERALD does not notice you the way prey notices a hunter. It notices you the way weather notices a field. You cannot face this alone — sound the call, muster 10 allied blades (you have 0). This is not courage. This is arithmetic.","have":0,"need":10,"musterExists":false,"alliesRaw":0,"alliesUnique":0,"havenValid":0,"readyManual":false,"readyGame":false,"omenStage":2,"omenDay":99,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":77,"opinion":40,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_2","name":"Thornfield","trust":92,"opinion":24,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":0,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":0},{"villageId":"village_3","name":"Ashford","trust":84,"opinion":44,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"facesFree":6,"already":0,"wouldRefuse":false,"wouldYield":6}],"linksActive":3,"callYield":6,"callOffered":true,"commitOffere