":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":38,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the west. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":39,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the west. They carried off ~1200 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":39,"line":"A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the west ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":39,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the west. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":40,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":41,"line":"⛓️ Finn brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":41,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":42,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":42,"line":"Village meal: +300 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":43,"line":"⛓️ Finn brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":43,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":44,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":44,"line":"⛓️ Finn brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":44,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":44,"line":"Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":45,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":45,"line":"Village meal: +400 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":45,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the west. They carried off ~1500 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":46,"line":"You give Stonebridge 1,386 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Amara weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":46,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":47,"line":"Village meal: +200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":48,"line":"Village meal: +400 kcal, +