 their head. \"Ask someone who trusts you.\" (Trust too low.)"},{"day":1,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":2,"line":"\"You haven't earned that yet,\" A person, maybe 30s says. (Trust too low.)"},{"day":2,"line":"A person, maybe 60s, with a farmer's tan hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":2,"line":"Village meal: +1200 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Gina hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":3,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Aidan hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":4,"line":"Village meal: +1050 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Aidan hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Aidan hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":5,"line":"Village meal: +1137 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Stonebridge, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":5,"line":"A runner from Thornfield, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":6,"line":"Village meal: +1170 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":7,"line":"Village meal: +1000 kcal, +1L water from the communal pantry. (Half ration — they don't trust you yet.)"},{"day":9,"line":"Aidan counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"2 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":10,"line":"📖 LEARNED: Light Fingers (Level 1). Steal from pantry without trust loss (50%). If caught, -20 trust."},{"day":13,"line":"Aidan counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 7 against.\""},{"day":13,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~1432 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":14,"line":"Aidan counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 6 against.\""},{"day":14,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~816 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":15,"line":"Aidan counts on their fingers, twice, like they don't trust the first number. Then, to the fire: \"1 for guilty. 7 against.\""},{"day":15,"line":"At the grave, Gina speaks for Marcus — \"Rahul trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":17,"line":"Olivia hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":18,"line":"Olivia hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":19,"line":"A runner from The Red Table, dusty and direct: \"Your foragers are stripping our side of the southwest ground. Back off — or we'll talk with teeth.\" (Trust -3. The commons cuts both ways.)"},{"day":20,"line":"At the grave, Gina, Andrei, Ethan speak for Aidan — \"Marcus trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":22,"line":"Ethan saw how close you've gotten to Olivia. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":23,"line":"Olivia saw how close you've gotten to Ethan. Old history has long eyes. (-2 trust)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Ethan brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,500 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Ibrahim weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Emberhold's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Emberhold's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Ethan brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":27,"line":"⛓️ Ethan brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":27,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the southwest. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves ar