, Blanca, Ernestine speak for Bao — \"Benjamin trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":23,"line":"Tatiana hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":23,"line":"Dalal hesitates, then backs off. \"Not today. Sorry.\" (Low trust — reluctant.)"},{"day":24,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":25,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: Stonebridge bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":26,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Stonebridge's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":26,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: Thornfield bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":27,"line":"🎁 Haven's first gesture: 2,000 kcal walks to Thornfield's fire — a gift, no strings. They count it, and they remember who sent it. (Trust +10.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":28,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":30,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~1425 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":31,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~942 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but