fusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":47,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,083 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Wren clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":49,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":51,"line":"⛓️ Bao brings it home: Emberhold bows to Haven — one organization, us primary. Tribute: 4,000 kcal/week. The relationship starts at trust 30. Everything from here is earned."},{"day":51,"line":"Three fires bow to Haven. But a realm isn't leverage — it's seasons. These bonds are young; tend them, keep the trust, and the court will come."},{"day":51,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1000 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":52,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":52,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,550 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Wren clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":53,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~800 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":54,"line":"🌙 Raid — Thornfield came in the night from the south. They carried off ~1000 kc