Y THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":99,"line":"🍲 The shared granary opens: 5,000 kcal for every fire of the realm, no strings. Stonebridge, Thornfield, Emberhold count it — and remember who fed them first. (Trust +10 with each.)"},{"day":100,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":100,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":101,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":102,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":102,"line":"You give Emberhold 1,720 kcal from Haven's bins — real food, honestly counted. Malik weeps, openly. \"The fire network. That's what it's FOR.\" (Trust +4. They owe you — the ledger remembers.)"},{"day":102,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They carried off ~1600 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":103,"line":"💛 You hold Notebook. Route optimizations, glitch lists, apocalypse patch notes. 'DO NOT TRUST THE CACHE BY THE RIVER.' Your magnum opus, half-finished. Your gifts are not mastered — but they are lived-in, and they are with you. The feast was the weapon. (The next feast grants FEASTED until tomorrow's dawn: strikes & abilities uplifted, devotion ×1.5 — richer feasts hit harder.)"},{"day":104,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":105,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":105,"line":"🌙 Raid — The Red Table came in the night from the southeast. They carried off ~1300 kcal from the pantry. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":106,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,750 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":106,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,500 kcal of grain to Thornfield's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day":107,"line":"At the grave, Blanca, Ernestine, Tatiana and 3 more speak for Dalal — \"Yuki trusted them. We saw it. Give them the fire's hearing.\" The village listens."},{"day":108,"line":"🌙 Raid — Stonebridge came in the night from the northwest. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":109,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":109,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":109,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 1,974 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Wren clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":111,"line":"🌙 Raid — Emberhold came in the night from the northeast. They trampled 2 garden plots into mud. Nobody's dead, but the message is clear: the ground is theirs too, and they're done asking. (Trust -10.)"},{"day":112,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Stonebridge turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":112,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Thornfield turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":112,"line":"🌾 Tribute wagons from Emberhold turn at the gate — our shelves are full past tomorrow. \"Eat well,\" we send back. \"That IS your tribute this week.\" (Trust +1.)"},{"day":114,"line":"🌪️ THE HERALD struck Emberhold in the night. They bled while the coalition talked. (trust −5 — they notice who wasn't there.)"},{"day":114,"line":"(Aid offer — accept or refuse from the beats row. Refusing costs pride: trust -3.)"},{"day":114,"line":"You accept Stonebridge's food — 2,068 kcal on the road, 2 day-parts out. Wren clasps your runner's shoulder. \"That's what the fire network is FOR.\" (Trust +4.)"},{"day":114,"line":"🌾 Haven sends 1,750 kcal of grain to Stonebridge's fire — not tribute, the other way around. Someone's grandmother over there will remember who fed her. (Trust +8.)"},{"day"